    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1743656688\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1743656688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1743656688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/264ffa9d00df888946140b850ae68fcb.poster.avif?t=1743656688\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/264ffa9d00df888946140b850ae68fcb.webm?t=1743656688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/264ffa9d00df888946140b850ae68fcb.mp4?t=1743656688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>&quot;Furry Killer&quot; presents an exhilarating and action-packed arena shooter experience that immerses players in a relentless battle against hordes of malevolent furry creatures. In this heart-pounding game, you assume the role of a formidable protagonist tasked with combating wave after wave of these fiendish foes.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/1d5b90c1be3a17fb73eaa2d4ab47dfe0.poster.avif?t=1743656688\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/1d5b90c1be3a17fb73eaa2d4ab47dfe0.webm?t=1743656688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/1d5b90c1be3a17fb73eaa2d4ab47dfe0.mp4?t=1743656688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intense Arena Battles: Engage in heart-pounding battles against relentless waves of evil furry creatures, testing your reflexes and combat skills in dynamic arena environments.<br></li><li>Coin-Driven Progression: Defeat foes strategically to collect coins that serve as currency for upgrading your arsenal of weapons, allowing you to tailor your firepower to your preferred playstyle.<br></li><li>Weapon Variety: Choose from a diverse selection of powerful and unique weapons, each with its own abilities and strengths, providing endless tactical possibilities for dealing with different enemy types.<br></li><li>Endless Mode Challenge: Push your limits in the endless mode, where waves of furry creatures become increasingly challenging, offering a true test of skill, endurance, and strategic thinking.<br></li><li>Immersive Visuals and Sound: Immerse yourself in a visually stunning and captivating world, enhanced by detailed arena designs and immersive sound effects that bring the intense battles and creatures to life.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1743656688\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1743656688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1743656688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/264ffa9d00df888946140b850ae68fcb.poster.avif?t=1743656688\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/264ffa9d00df888946140b850ae68fcb.webm?t=1743656688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/264ffa9d00df888946140b850ae68fcb.mp4?t=1743656688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>&quot;Furry Killer&quot; presents an exhilarating and action-packed arena shooter experience that immerses players in a relentless battle against hordes of malevolent furry creatures. In this heart-pounding game, you assume the role of a formidable protagonist tasked with combating wave after wave of these fiendish foes.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/1d5b90c1be3a17fb73eaa2d4ab47dfe0.poster.avif?t=1743656688\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/1d5b90c1be3a17fb73eaa2d4ab47dfe0.webm?t=1743656688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206460/extras/1d5b90c1be3a17fb73eaa2d4ab47dfe0.mp4?t=1743656688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intense Arena Battles: Engage in heart-pounding battles against relentless waves of evil furry creatures, testing your reflexes and combat skills in dynamic arena environments.<br></li><li>Coin-Driven Progression: Defeat foes strategically to collect coins that serve as currency for upgrading your arsenal of weapons, allowing you to tailor your firepower to your preferred playstyle.<br></li><li>Weapon Variety: Choose from a diverse selection of powerful and unique weapons, each with its own abilities and strengths, providing endless tactical possibilities for dealing with different enemy types.<br></li><li>Endless Mode Challenge: Push your limits in the endless mode, where waves of furry creatures become increasingly challenging, offering a true test of skill, endurance, and strategic thinking.<br></li><li>Immersive Visuals and Sound: Immerse yourself in a visually stunning and captivating world, enhanced by detailed arena designs and immersive sound effects that bring the intense battles and creatures to life.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Furry Killer&quot; is a fast-paced arena shooter where you fight against waves of evil furry creatures. Defeat them, collect coins, and upgrade your weapons to survive in an endless mode.",
